window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Asset File 4-7: Elizabeth Watkins.</p> <p>Genotype: Non-Human.</p> <p>That's the only information Jayson Masters has about his newest assignment. To learn more, he'll need to infiltrate her life in the most intimate of ways without getting too close.</p> <p>Game on.</p> <p>Lizzie's new neighbor is loud, seductive, and ridiculously attractive. And he keeps flirting with her. With the recent death of a close friend hanging over her head, Lizzie tentatively agrees to a new friendship in hopes of ignoring her broken heart.</p> <p>A web of lies isn't sustainable forever.</p> <p>And sometimes love isn't enough.</p> <p>An immortal war is brewing, and she's the key...</p>"; 
